Inline table access fast paths in the z8lua VM.

GETTABUP, GETTABLE, SELF, SETTABUP and SETTABLE previously always called
luaV_gettable/luaV_settable and then luaH_get's type switch.  For a plain
table indexed by a short string or integral number whose entry already
exists, look the slot up directly in the dispatch loop.  Missing entries,
metamethods, string indexing and the _ENV sandbox fallback keep the
original path.  Applies after z8lua-env-fallback.patch.

